[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 308.23, "timestamp": "00:05:08", "text": "夥計。例如，睡眠現在是不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 311.31, "timestamp": "00:05:11", "text": "不好了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 318.31, "timestamp": "00:05:18", "text": "？我不知道。我昨天"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 322.469, "timestamp": "00:05:22", "text": "睡得很早，所以我寫了“I I”，然後我寫了“V”。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 326.39, "timestamp": "00:05:26", "text": "昨天已經……對不起，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 329.43, "timestamp": "00:05:29", "text": "今天可能會抱怨幾句。是的，昨天我還在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 332.59000000000003, "timestamp": "00:05:32", "text": "考慮要不要再直播一次，因為，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 335.909, "timestamp": "00:05:35", "text": "我也不想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 339.99, "timestamp": "00:05:39", "text": "打破我正在進行的24小時連續直播的紀錄"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 344.87, "timestamp": "00:05:44", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 347.59000000000003, "timestamp": "00:05:47", "text": "呃，已經持續兩個月了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 351.909, "timestamp": "00:05:51", "text": "這是第二個月了，我就想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 354.23, "timestamp": "00:05:54", "text": "好吧，我還是把直播打開吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 357.11, "timestamp": "00:05:57", "text": "就算像是在熬夜直播，我也會去睡覺。是的，你"}]